{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "tvmaze-middleware-api-collection",
    "name": "TVMaze Middleware API",
    "description": "Colección completa de la API Middleware TVMaze. Incluye todos los endpoints implementados:\n- **Endpoint A**: Búsqueda de shows\n- **Endpoint B**: Detalle de show (con caché en MongoDB)\n- **Endpoint C**: Guardar comentario y calificación\n\n**Cómo usar:**\n1. Importar esta colección en Postman\n2. Configurar la variable de entorno `BASE_URL` (por defecto: http://localhost:8080)\n3. Asegúrate de tener MongoDB corriendo o configura MONGODB_URI\n4. Ejecutar la aplicación con `java -jar target/tvmaze-api-1.0.0.jar`\n5. ¡Listo para probar!",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "BASE_URL",
      "value": "http://localhost:8080",
      "type": "string",
      "description": "URL base de la API. Cambiar según el entorno."
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "A - Búsqueda de Shows",
      "description": "Carpeta con todos los escenarios del Endpoint A: Búsqueda de shows por criterio",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "A1 - Buscar shows (resultado con comentarios)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{BASE_URL}}/api/search?search_query=breaking bad",
              "host": ["{{BASE_URL}}"],
              "path": ["api", "search"],
              "query": [
                {
                  "key": "search_query",
                  "value": "breaking bad",
                  "description": "Término de búsqueda"
                }
              ]
            },
            "description": "Busca shows en TVMaze por un criterio y retorna un arreglo con id, name, channel, summary, genres y los comentarios guardados en MongoDB para cada show.\n\n**Respuesta esperada:** Array de objetos ShowResponseDTO con campo `comments` incluido."
          },
          "response": [
            {
              "name": "Búsqueda exitosa - Breaking Bad",
              "originalRequest": {
                "method": "GET",
                "url": {
                  "raw": "{{BASE_URL}}/api/search?search_query=breaking bad",
                  "host": ["{{BASE_URL}}"],
                  "path": ["api", "search"],
                  "query": [{"key": "search_query", "value": "breaking bad"}]
                }
              },
              "status": "OK",
              "code": 200,
              "_postman_previewlanguage": "json",
              "header": [{"key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json"}],
              "body": "[\n  {\n    \"id\": 169,\n    \"name\": \"Breaking Bad\",\n    \"channel\": \"AMC\",\n    \"summary\": \"<p>Breaking Bad follows protagonist Walter White...\",\n    \"genres\": [\"Drama\", \"Crime\", \"Thriller\"],\n    \"comments\": []\n  }\n]"
            }
          ],
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Status code es 200', function () {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
                  "});",
                  "",
                  "pm.test('La respuesta es un arreglo', function () {",
                  "    var jsonData = pm.response.json();",
                  "    pm.expect(jsonData).to.be.an('array');",
                  "});",
                  "",
                  "pm.test('Cada show tiene los campos requeridos', function () {",
                  "    var jsonData = pm.response.json();",
                  "    if (jsonData.length > 0) {",
                  "        var show = jsonData[0];",
                  "        pm.expect(show).to.have.property('id');",
                  "        pm.expect(show).to.have.property('name');",
                  "        pm.expect(show).to.have.property('channel');",
                  "        pm.expect(show).to.have.property('summary');",
                  "        pm.expect(show).to.have.property('genres');",
                  "        pm.expect(show).to.have.property('comments');",
                  "        pm.expect(show.genres).to.be.an('array');",
                  "        pm.expect(show.comments).to.be.an('array');",
                  "        // Guardar el primer showId para pruebas posteriores",
                  "        pm.environment.set('SHOW_ID', show.id);",
                  "    }",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "A2 - Buscar shows: Game of Thrones",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [{"key": "Accept", "value": "application/json"}],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{BASE_URL}}/api/search?search_query=game of thrones",
              "host": ["{{BASE_URL}}"],
              "path": ["api", "search"],
              "query": [{"key": "search_query", "value": "game of thrones"}]
